# Declarations that hold only while this repository is type-checked, and are
# deliberately not part of what the gem publishes.
#
# ResourceProxy forwards the collection shorthands with Forwardable, so the
# type checker has to know the class extends it before it can see
# `def_delegators` on the singleton. Consumers never need that: the published
# signatures declare each forwarded method concretely, which is what a caller
# is checked against, and naming Forwardable there would make `rbs validate`
# fail for anyone who has not loaded the stdlib declarations for it.
module ZammadAPI
  class ResourceProxy
    extend Forwardable
  end
end
